Subject: [PATCH] dwc2d: list the enumerated devices in
 /scheme/usb.dwc2/devices

Each device's address, hub port, IDs, class, USB version, speed and
interfaces, one line per device, read-only, for lsusb.

Refs redox-rpi/redox-rpi#35

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
